<view class="who-mask" wx:if="{{show}}" bindtap="onClose" catchtouchmove="noop">
  <view class="who-sheet" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="who-grab"></view>

    <view class="who-hd">
      <text class="who-t">你是家里的哪位？</text>
      <view class="who-x" bindtap="onClose">✕</view>
    </view>

    <view class="who-tip">这台设备上还没认过你。选一下自己 —— 以后就不会再问，也不会多出成员。</view>

    <scroll-view class="who-list" scroll-y>
      <view
        class="who-i"
        wx:for="{{members}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="onPick"
      >
        <view class="who-av" style="background:{{item.color}}">{{item.initial}}</view>
        <view class="who-nm">{{item.nickname || '未命名'}}</view>
        <text class="who-go">这是我 ›</text>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="who-new" bindtap="onCreate">都不是，我是新成员</view>
  </view>
</view>
